<title>USA: Dow Jones average gains more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow Jones average gains more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average gained more than 50 points Friday afternoon in trading linked to options expirations.</p>
<p>Just after 2 p.m. EDT, the Dow was up 52.98 points at 6,711.58, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
